# StatusForge UI language template — canonical English (en)
#
# This is the SOURCE template. Do not translate this file directly — copy it
# (see i18n/README.md) and translate the copy instead. This file is also the
# schema: `npm run i18n:build` treats every key here as required, and flags
# any translated file that's missing a key, has an extra/unknown key, or
# still has the untouched English text on the right-hand side.
#
# Format, one entry per line:
#   key.path = "text"
# - Never edit the key (left of "="). It's what the app looks up at runtime.
# - Only the quoted text on the right is translated.
# - Lines starting with "#" are comments (context for translators) and are
#   ignored by the build script.
# - Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Keys are grouped by where they appear in the app. This is a starter set
# pulled from the real UI (App.tsx, LibraryView.tsx, DashboardView.tsx,
# views/*.tsx, components/*.tsx) — it is NOT every string in the app yet.
# Extend this file (and re-run the build for every translated file) as more
# UI gets covered; see i18n/README.md for the workflow.

